p:7%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%99%9A%E6%9E%84%E9%9B%86\" title=\"虚构集\"><img alt=\"虚构集\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/HeadIconSmall-311401.png/100px-HeadIconSmall-311401.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/e/e7/HeadIconSmall-311401.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%99%9A%E6%9E%84%E9%9B%86\" title=\"虚构集\">虚构集</a></span></span></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">实装版本：</span>3.6</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:3em\">来源：</span>点唱机</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">所属系列：</span>岁月的书签</div></div><div><div class=\"grey-small test-hide hide-m\">编号ID：311404</div></div></div></div><div class=\"skin-video tabber\"><h2><span id=\".E8.A7.86.E9.A2.91.E9.A2.84.E8.A7.88\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"视频预览\">视频预览</span></h2><div class=\"tabber-filter\" style=\"margin:0 -3px 4px -3px\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button selected\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"4\">技能1</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"3\">技能2</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"2\">大招</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"1\">入场</div></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"4\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3114/311404/虚构集-技能1.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3114/311404/虚构集-技能1 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"3\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3114/311404/虚构集-技能2.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3114/311404/虚构集-技能2 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"2\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3114/311404/虚构集-仪式.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3114/311404/虚构集-仪式 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"1\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3114/311404/虚构集-入场.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3114/311404/虚构集-入场 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div></div><h2><span id=\".E7.AA.97.E4.B8.AD.E4.BE.A7.E5.86.99_Garment_Display\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"窗中侧写_Garment_Display\">窗中侧写<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">Garment Display</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"infopad\">库埃纳瓦卡露营地的夜晚，伴随着诗人的歌声，青年作家踏上了流浪的旅途。然后是纺织厂，女工的叛乱为这份艰苦而短暂的工作画下句号。前往布宜诺斯艾利斯的船上，宽广的拉普拉塔河见证着她想要成为水手的远大理想。<br />遗憾的是，她并没有成为一个优秀的水手。她最终只是在船上完成了一首诗，一首并不完美的、无视韵脚与韵律的短诗。这首诗可以算得上错漏百出，但考虑到她的旅途始于寻找自我，这些凌乱的瞬间，也不过是自我这条曲折而漫长的河流中所溅起的一串水花。<br />历经了挣扎、困苦，以及愚蠢而无畏的冒险，青年作家终于走到了这里。她推开了面前的那一扇门。在想象中，它理应闪闪发光，镶嵌着金黄与翠绿；但在现实里，它如此朴素，平平无奇，只是能隐约听到后头的海浪声响，也许门后还能看到远方的灯塔。一个适合沉思与写作的地方。<br />亲爱的小作家，从此以后，愿你永远拥有一间属于自己的房间。</div><div id=\"崭新单品\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.B4.AD.E6.96.B0.E5.8D.95.E5.93.81_All-new_Item\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"崭新单品_All-new_Item\">崭新单品<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">All-new Item</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"char-item-box0 tabber\"><div class=\"char-item-box1 tabber-item\" data-skinid=\"311404\"><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-311407.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/2/2e/Belonging-311407.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">“文字的引领”<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">\"Let Words Guide\"</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"雨滴\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Value-1.png/27px-Value-1.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"雨滴\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bb/Value-1.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />5<hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>一本……笔记本。一块经过重新打磨的菲涅尔透镜被用作笔记本的封皮，会依照翻阅者的心绪而映射出悠远的光辉。<br />有力的文字等同于长明的灯塔，它们都能指示方向、引领迷航。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-311408.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/8/8a/Belonging-311408.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">一封长信<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">A Long Letter</div></div></div><div>无估值<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到60%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>一卷绵长的信笺。它们由谁书写、向谁寄出，受访者表示无法一一列举。<br />“但正是因为与形形色色的‘他们’不断对话，我才成为了我。”</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-311409.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/2/22/Belonging-311409.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">“随处书写”<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">\"Write Everywhere\"</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />150<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到100%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>七分袖白色连身裙，各处涂写着文字。墨迹大多仓促而潦草，难以辨认。<br />她总是笔不离手，随时准备捕捉那些照亮生命本质的瞬间。而这件裙装则与稿纸、墙壁一起，见证了灵感付诸笔端时的超越与迷狂。</div></div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E8.A1.A3.E7.9D.80.E6.B5.B7.E6.8A.A5\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"衣着海报\">衣着海报</span></h2><div style=\"display:flex; gap:10px; border:1px solid #b55829; width:fit-content\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%96%87%E5%AD%97%EF%BC%8C%E8%87%AA%E5%A7%8B%E8%87%B3%E7%BB%881.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 文字，自始至终1.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%96%87%E5%AD%97%EF%BC%8C%E8%87%AA%E5%A7%8B%E8%87%B3%E7%BB%881.jpg/228px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%96%87%E5%AD%97%EF%BC%8C%E8%87%AA%E5%A7%8B%E8%87%B3%E7%BB%881.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"228\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%96%87%E5%AD%97%EF%BC%8C%E8%87%AA%E5%A7%8B%E8%87%B3%E7%BB%881.jpg/342px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%96%87%E5%AD%97%EF%BC%8C%E8%87%AA%E5%A7%8B%E8%87%B3%E7%BB%881.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%96%87%E5%AD%97%EF%BC%8C%E8%87%AA%E5%A7%8B%E8%87%B3%E7%BB%881.jpg/456px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%96%87%E5%AD%97%EF%BC%8C%E8%87%AA%E5%A7%8B%E8%87%B3%E7%BB%881.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1540\" /></a><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%96%87%E5%AD%97%EF%BC%8C%E8%87%AA%E5%A7%8B%E8%87%B3%E7%BB%882.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 文字，自始至终2.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%96%87%E5%AD%97%EF%BC%8C%E8%87%AA%E5%A7%8B%E8%87%B3%E7%BB%882.jpg/228px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%96%87%E5%AD%97%EF%BC%8C%E8%87%AA%E5%A7%8B%E8%87%B3%E7%BB%882.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"228\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%96%87%E5%AD%97%EF%BC%8C%E8%87%AA%E5%A7%8B%E8%87%B3%E7%BB%882.jpg/342px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%96%87%E5%AD%97%EF%BC%8C%E8%87%AA%E5%A7%8B%E8%87%B3%E7%BB%882.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%96%87%E5%AD%97%EF%BC%8C%E8%87%AA%E5%A7%8B%E8%87%B3%E7%BB%882.jpg/456px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%96%87%E5%AD%97%EF%BC%8C%E8%87%AA%E5%A7%8B%E8%87%B3%E7%BB%882.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1540\" /></a></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "衣着"}], "displaytitle": "<span style=\"display:inline-block\"><span style=\"display: flex;flex-direction: column;\">文字，自始至终 <small style=\"color: grey\">The Weight of Words</small></span></span>"}}